msgid "mykatrain:llm-coach:title"
msgstr "LLM Coach — translate KataGo output via LLM"

msgid "mykatrain:llm-coach:workflow-hint"
msgstr ""
"[Workflow]\n"
"1. Confirm the Karte JSON path in the text field above.\n"
"2. Click 'Generate & Copy Prompt' — the Markdown prompt goes to the clipboard.\n"
"3. Paste it manually into Claude / ChatGPT / Gemini.\n"
"4. Paste the LLM's reply into the response text area below.\n"
"5. Click 'Validate' to check symptom IDs and move numbers.\n"
"6. Optionally click 'Copy Result' to share the report."

